<!--
  Home / dashboard. This is **English** (the default), Chinese is in values-zh/.

  Two families of names live here and must not be collapsed into one another:
  `home_card_default_*` is what a card **calls itself** when it has no title (it is
  rendered as the card heading), while `home_metric_*` / `home_dimension_*` /
  `home_source_*` are what an **item in a dropdown** is called (editor only).
  Chinese uses 「设备」 for both; so does English, but they are two different things.
-->
